• AO1: Demonstrate knowledge and understanding, using appropriate terminology and

notation, of standard statistical techniques used to:
• collect and represent data
• calculate summary statistics and probabilities.

• AO2: Interpret statistical information and results in context and reason statistically to draw

conclusions.

• AO3: Assess the appropriateness of statistical methodologies and the conclusions drawn

through the application of the statistical enquiry cycle.

