+    "replace": "<li data-narration-id=\"n19\"><strong>RPI (Retail Price Index):</strong> Measures changes in the average price of a basket of goods and services purchased by households. Published monthly by the ONS, it is a legacy measure used for long-term indexation, including index-linked gilts and bonds.</li>",
