+    "path": "[4].marks",
+    "expect": "Award 1 mark per reason and 1 mark per justification, up to 5 marks.\nMastering: Two reasons, each with a justification linking to a specific feature of time series extrapolation.\n- The past trend may not continue [1]; economic conditions (interest rates, housing policy, global events) can shift the trend direction in ways that are impossible to predict 10 years ahead, so the extrapolated line may diverge significantly from actual prices [1].\n- Seasonal effects compound over time [1]; even small seasonal fluctuations accumulate over 10 years of extrapolation, making point estimates increasingly unreliable as the prediction horizon extends [1].\n- The time series itself may contain outliers or one-off events (e.g. a financial crash) [1]; if such events influenced the trend line used for extrapolation, the forecast inherits these distortions [1].\nSecure: Two reasons, one justified.\nDeveloping: One reason with a justification.\nEmerging: States 'the future is uncertain' without specifying why the time series makes it unreliable.",
+    "value": "Award 1 mark per reason and 1 mark per justification, up to 5 marks.\nMastering: Two reasons, each with a justification linking to a specific feature of time series extrapolation.\n- The past trend may not continue [1]; economic conditions (interest rates, housing policy, global events) can shift the trend direction in ways that are impossible to predict 10 years ahead, so the extrapolated line may diverge significantly from actual prices [1].\n- Seasonal patterns may change [1]; a pattern that has repeated in the past may alter, so a 10-year forecast may not match future prices [1].\n- The time series itself may contain outliers or one-off events (e.g. a financial crash) [1]; if such events influenced the trend line used for extrapolation, the forecast inherits these distortions [1].\nSecure: Two reasons, one justified.\nDeveloping: One reason with a justification.\nEmerging: States 'the future is uncertain' without specifying why the time series makes it unreliable.",
